      "kind": "ANSWERED",
      "text": "The two versions conflict. The English says a 10% service charge is added to all lunch orders, while the Japanese original says the 10% service charge at lunch applies only to customers who order a course. So per the Japanese, non-course lunch orders would not incur it.",
